 "lede": "The agent knows which agents are alive, which have gone silent and who asked whom for what. Work held by a silent agent is taken back and reassigned. Large jobs are split into small ones and handed to short-lived workers. What the agents did becomes searchable notes, so an error turns into a lesson and an approval into a recorded decision. A digest arrives every day.",
